# Untapping the Silos in response to its upkeep trigger prevents the counter (CR 603.4).
[Bot1 Deck]
Sand Silos
Black Lotus
Voyaging Satyr
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Voyaging Satyr.Cast
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
Bot1.Hand.Sand Silos.Play
[T3 Bot1.Untap]
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Battlefield.Voyaging Satyr.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Sand Silos)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sand Silos.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Sand Silos.Counters.Storage = (absent)
